dus combines dungeon crawling, deckbuilding and survival. Your deck is your body, inventory and clock: wounds, hunger and exhaustion become cards, and cycling through your deck advances time.Fight, search for supplies and choose when to rest. Every expedition puts your deck—and your survival—to the test.Play the free demo: If you enjoy your time in","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-15T22:18:45Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1846651706679439","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984970-1845383656392419","game_id":"steam-4984970","kind":"update","title":"Small demo update: fixes, faster animations and new languages","summary":"The Submundus demo has received a small update:Fixed torch duration displays showing the same value whether the torch was in use or not.Fixed dropping and picking up a torch resetting its remaining duration.Slightly sped up animations.Added Brazilian Portuguese and Spanish localization.You can select your language in Settings. Thanks for playing!","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-10-05T02:20:02Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656392419","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984970-1845383656379231","game_id":"steam-4984970","kind":"update","title":"Demo update: clearer targeting, tutorial guidance and room transitions","summary":"Thanks to everyone who tried the demo and shared feedback today! This update brings a few improvements:Aligned targeting arrow tips with the mouse cursor.Added clearer explanations of how Wound cards are gained.Added a confirmation when skipping the tutorial, explaining what it covers.Added a notice when attempting to return to the room you just left.Replaced the room transition text screen with a map transition showing newly revealed rooms.Thanks for helping me improve Submundus.","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T23:46:59Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656379231","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"},{"id":"steam-steam-4984970-1845383656377463","game_id":"steam-4984970","kind":"announcement","title":"Submundus Demo Is Now Available!","summary":"You wake in a cell deep beneath the world, with no memory of who you are. Your way out begins here.The free Submundus demo is now available! Explore dangerous rooms, fight turn-based battles, and search for the resources you need to survive.Your deck is your body, your inventory, and your clock. Wounds, hunger, thirst, and fatigue become cards that clog your hands. Every fight and every decision to explore or rest shapes your chances of reaching the surface.The demo offers roughly 30–60 minutes ","occurred_at":null,"published_at":"2026-09-30T12:40:56Z","time_precision":"minute","source_url":"https://steamstore-a.akamaihd.net/news/externalpost/steam_community_announcements/1845383656377463","verified_at":"2026-10-20T19:55:43Z","discovery_method":"official_steam_news","content_review":"source_only"}],"analyses":[],"news_status":{"steam-4984970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:13Z","status":"ok","all_sources_checked_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:12Z","error_codes":[]}},"news_last_attempt_at":{"steam-4984970":"2026-10-26T05:55:13Z"},"notices":[],"news_sources":{"4984970":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:12Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:12Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]},"5273910":{"last_attempt_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:13Z","last_success_at":"2026-10-26T05:55:13Z","status":"ok","error_codes":[]}},"context_snapshots":[{"schema_version":1,"game_id":"steam-4984970","app_